<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Switch (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>switch &lt;monster&gt;
switch              (go back to your own body)
</pre>
<p>Takes over a monster's body: you see what it sees, and your commands are 
its commands, until you switch back. The monster may be here or anywhere 
in the world, but no other god may be in it already ("... body is already 
in use!"). Only monsters can be switched into, never players. Your own 
body stays where you left it meanwhile.
</p><p>Fine for playing a part in a quest. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Force</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Snoop</a>
</pre>




</div>